Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)
```turtle
@prefix : <http://cecs571.csulb.edu/ontology/cornercase#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:scene1 a :Scene ;
    :scenarioName "Dog Running on Road at Night" ;
    :hasCornerCaseType :cc1 .

:cc1 a :BehaviorAnomaly ;
    :hasActor :actor1 ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :weather1 ;
    :hasRisk :risk1 ;
    :hasObstacle :obstacle1 .

:actor1 a :Actor ; 
    a :Vehicle ;  # Assuming the dog is another form of actor
    :description "A dog running into the road" .

:weather1 a :NightCondition ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :FoggyCondition .

:obstacle1 a :RoadObject ;
    :description "Dog on the road" .

:risk1 a :PedestrianCollisionRisk ;
    :description "Risk of collision with the dog" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev1 .

:sev1 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.75"^^xsd:float .
```

Identified Risks for each risk class
Risk 1:
Description: Risk of collision with the dog
Severity Score: 0.75